note S4 out (spec 6, erratum E1): an exported entry with an unsized view, an out of 4 bytes and a scalar
note (slots x0 s, x1 len s, x2 r, x3 k); r is written element by element (bytes pinned).
om2
export fn rev s view uchar * r out uchar 4 k uchar to void
for i ulong 4
put r i add k get s sub 3 i
end
end
